 "punch": "BLINKED",
 "sentences": [
  {
   "slot": "H1",
   "text": "For a hundred and thirty-six years, he has never blinked.",
   "kind": "HOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "years",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H2",
   "text": "Everyone sees the Devil, waiting in the dark.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "devil",
     "to": "man"
    },
    {
     "on": "dark",
     "to": "main_action"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H3",
   "text": "A black wing hangs at his side.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "wing",
     "to": "wing"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H3",
   "text": "His fist holds up his chin.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "fist",
     "to": "hand_chin"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H3",
   "text": "And his eyes burn straight into yours.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "eyes",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H4",
   "text": "Franz Stuck painted him in 1890 and called him Lucifer.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 1
  },
  {
   "slot": "H5",
   "text": "A year later, Ferdinand of Bulgaria bought him for his royal collection.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 4,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "collection",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "Why would a ruler want the Devil watching him?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "devil",
     "to": "face"
    },
    {
     "on": "watching",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H6",
   "text": "The answer is in his name.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "name",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "Lucifer was the Roman name for the morning star.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 10,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "star",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "The star that fell from heaven.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 11,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "heaven",
     "to": "main_action"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H7",
   "text": "Paris and Berlin later hung him in an exhibition about melancholy.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 8,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "melancholy",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H8",
   "text": "He isn't plotting.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "plotting",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H8",
   "text": "He's grieving.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "grieving",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "H9",
   "text": "So is he waiting to strike, or waiting to be forgiven?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
